#3901
A Magical Shoreline~
   As you gaze into the horizon, you are suddenly blinded by a searing white
light.  When the light fades and your vision returns, you find yourself
standing before a vast expanse of sparkling blue water, as pure as the finest
sapphire.  As you ponder this extraordinary aquatic wonder that has appeared
before you, you wonder just what adventures and riches lie in this mystical
sea.  And, as if on cue, you notice a sign, half-buried in the fine, white sand
you are now standing on.    
~
