0 0 17521
E
sign infomercial diggersageek~
   Beware ye who dare to traverse this Mystical Ocean, for although this ocean,
a junction between all the myriads of realms in the multiverse, is my gift to 
you, these waters contain dangers of which even I will not speak.  Also, 'tis my
wish for only the stoutest of heart and strength to travel this ocean.  Ergo, 
I have placed guardians at the entrances to these realms.  Thout shalt not pass
these guardians unless ye be of stronger mettle.  Those who cannot pass will
surely die.

                                                       A Warning,
    ~
S
#3902
On the Mystic Ocean~
   You are on a pure blue ocean that stretches as far as the eye can see.  The
water around you seems to sparkle with an almost magical nature.  It seems so
peaceful out here that you could just gaze at the ocean forever.  It's so 
hypnotic that you don't seem to notice the dark figure silently circling you
below the surface.
~
