#3933
Beginning of the Coral Reef~
   As you exit the whirlpool you notice that you have come across a huge coral
reef blocking your way to the east, south, and west.  The only way through the
reef is through a series of twisting, turning, chutes.  Suddenly, you seem less
awe-struck by the magical nature of this ocean and more afraid of it.  You seem
to sense someone watching you...
~
39 8 0 0 0 8 255 0
D0
You see the twisting chutes of the coral reef.
~
~
0 0 3934
S
#3934
In the Reefs~
   As you swim through the endless tunnels and chutes formed from the massive
coral reef, you notice that as you look at the reef itself, it seems to shift
color constantly.  Its mezmerizing effect seems to calm your nerves a little, 
but you still can't quite shake the feeling that you are being monitored...
watched...studied...
~
